photos":null,"descs":"财前五郎（唐泽寿明 饰）和里见修二（江口洋介 饰）是同期实习的医生，但二者却走上了截然不同的道路。财前凭借高超的个人技术成为了外科部实际上的第一教授。财前的咄咄逼人让即将退休的第一外科教授东真藏（石坂浩二 饰）感到威胁，东教授决定另立他人。因此极具野心的财前寻求其岳父— —财前妇产诊所院长财前又一（西田敏行 饰）和第一内科教授鹈饲（伊武雅刀 饰）的帮助，通过贿赂和拉帮结派，历经波折，最终获得了第一外科教授的职位。而他的同期，第一内科助教里见却是位实事求是，热心研究的学者。二者的不同选择导致了最后不同的命运。位高权重的财前终于到达梦想的高处，却发现不胜寒风，悲剧也因此上演。\n　　本剧改编自山崎丰子的同名巨作。号称“日本国民级小说”。前后经历过五次翻拍，数次被搬上荧屏。内容直指医院的黑暗面，时隔多年，依旧具有现实意义。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1_Upxg6-NGm7C56jk4rJV0g?pwd=te3c\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":37,"title":"霸王别姬","ratingNum":9.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2561716440.webp","tag":"No.2豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国大陆 / 中国香港","years":"1993","date":"1993-07-26(中国大陆)、1993-01-01(中国香港)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1665762739.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581065129.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1949228542.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p504397690.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p950669794.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2561716440.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2585897495.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p452855329.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2591403415.webp\"]","descs":"段小楼（张丰毅）与程蝶衣（张国荣）是一对打小一起长大的师兄弟，两人一个演生，一个饰旦，一向配合天衣无缝，尤其一出《霸王别姬》，更是誉满京城，为此，两人约定合演一辈子《霸王别姬》。但两人对戏剧与人生关系的理解有本质不同，段小楼深知戏非人生，程蝶衣则是人戏不分。\n　　段小楼在认为该成家立业之时迎娶了名妓菊仙（巩俐），致使程蝶衣认定菊仙是可耻的第三者，使段小楼做了叛徒，自此，三人围绕一出《霸王别姬》生出的爱恨情仇战开始随着时代风云的变迁不断升级，终酿成悲剧。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/16CErdwtxBKQduPqacq4RRg?pwd=6t6p\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-27\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":39,"title":"控方证人 Witness for the Prosecution","ratingNum":9.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 犯罪片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2911817201.webp","tag":"No.19豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国","years":"1957","date":"1957-12-17(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2573117210.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1963073081.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1184248811.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1963070215.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2513251505.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1505392928.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2573117270.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2896290400.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2896290398.webp\"]","descs":"伦敦著名刑案辩护律师韦菲爵士（查尔斯·劳顿 Charles Laughton 饰）接受了心脏病治疗，但是身体依旧虚弱，第一天回家休养，护士一直严厉监督他服药，并杜绝烟酒。管家为了便于上楼，还专门为他修了电梯。但是，种种关心照顾，对于这位桀骜不驯、牙尖嘴利的大律师根本不起作用，反倒是一纸诉状令他倍感兴奋。律师梅休和当事人沃尔（泰隆·鲍华 Tyrone Power饰）登门拜访，请他出山打官司。原来，沃尔结识了富婆，两人相见甚欢，虽然仆人对他发明的打蛋器充满鄙夷，但是富婆却对他充满爱意，甚至为他修改了遗嘱，把8万英镑留给了他。然而，富婆却惨遭毒手。于是，沃尔成为警方的头号嫌疑犯。他的唯一证人是妻子克里斯汀（玛琳·黛德丽 Marlene Dietrich饰），然而后者登门时的冷漠与淡定，令韦菲爵士怀疑这其中另有隐情。在扑朔迷离的案件背后，隐藏着一个个环环相扣... (展开全部) ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1XXYsw5pRhRR979UimLks0Q?pwd=nij4\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-27\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":40,"title":"茶馆","ratingNum":9.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 历史片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2528965424.webp","tag":"No.116豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国大陆","years":"1982","date":"1982(中国大陆)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2262122506.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2262122341.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2262122428.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2262121136.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2262124436.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2262122096.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2528965424.webp\"]","descs":"世纪之交，古老的中国正迎来前所未有的巨大变革。老态龙钟的大清王朝摇摇欲坠，六君子的鲜血无法阻止历史车轮的滚动，老北京城的上空风云变幻，波谲云诡。王利发（于是之 饰），北京城内裕泰茶馆的年轻掌柜。他谨记父亲的教诲，体面周全地迎送四方宾客。小小的茶馆内，三教九流各色人等穿梭于此：提笼架鸟哀叹时运的松二爷（黄宗洛 饰）；慨叹国之将亡的刚毅满人常四爷（郑榕 饰）；一心谋求实业救国的秦仲义（蓝天野 饰）；丧尽天良买卖人口的刘麻子（英若诚 饰）；打算娶老婆的庞太监（童超 饰）……你方唱罢我登场，小小茶馆之内演尽世间的沧桑与凄凉……\n　　本片根据老舍同名原著改编，并1983年第3届中国电影金鸡奖特别奖、文化部1982年优秀影片奖特别奖。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1XVejOuPcd56z4HHb7xs2HQ?pwd=d8dq\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-27\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":105,"title":"山花烂漫时","ratingNum":9.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2912813745.webp","tag":"No.10|豆瓣高分华语剧集榜","address":" 中国大陆","years":"2024","date":"","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2902565008.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2902565074.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2913352068.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2912744960.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2902565073.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2912813745.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2912860500.webp\"]","descs":"该剧根据“七一勋章”获得者张桂梅事迹改编。 　　张桂梅（宋佳 饰）是中国西部山区的一名普通中学女教师，多年间她不断目睹自己的女学生因家庭贫穷而辍学，在15、16岁的年纪或嫁人生子、或外出打工，这让张桂梅无比痛心和惋惜。她立志要办一所全免费的女子高中，让这些大山里的女孩获得受教育的机会、能够考上大学、走出大山，彻底改变 命运。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1GEVpIyX3J-ZyFL541Wx-ww?pwd=n49n\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":611,"title":"切尔诺贝利","ratingNum":9.6,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2555445285.webp","tag":"剧情","address":" 英国 / 美国","years":"2019","date":"","photos":null,"descs":"1986年4月26日凌晨1点23分，乌克兰普里皮亚季附近的切尔诺贝利核电厂第四号反应堆突然爆炸。肃杀漆黑的夜晚，大量放射性物质进入大气蔓延到苏东和东欧地区。消防队员第一时间赶到现场，但因缺乏有效的防护措施，他们的身体遭到不可逆转的毁灭性伤害。与之相对，核电站主要负责人和相关政府官员并未积极处理善后工作，而是想方设法谎报灾情，降低对外影响。高高在上的老爷们，只顾全自己的颜面和乌纱帽，而无数的消防员、军人、矿工、百姓则成为这场巨大灾难的无辜受害者。\n　　切尔诺比利，一个永远不能被遗忘的名字，它早已成为地球表面以及人类灵魂上一道难以磨灭的伤疤…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1JXASVD58bFLVfzKL1JTVjA?pwd=bf4u\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":38,"title":"阿甘正传 Forrest Gump","ratingNum":9.5,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2372307693.webp","tag":"No.4豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国","years":"1994","date":"1994-06-23(洛杉矶首映)、1994-07-06(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1484731332.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1484731424.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581065265.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2564490544.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p825966094.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2500944103.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2372307693.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?